Both buttons are positioned directly below the channel name/info area and above the video description snippet, so they're immediately visible without needing to open any menus. They include appropriate icons (person-add for Subscribe, playlist for Add to playlist) and match YouTube's visual style with rounded pill-shaped buttons.

